## Verification (MANDATORY!)
Before saying "done":
1. npx tsc --noEmit → ZERO errors
2. npm run build → Success
3. npm test → All pass
4. Include results in response

## Commands
dev: npm run dev
build: npm run build
test: npm test
typecheck: npx tsc --noEmit
lint: npm run lint

## NEVER
- Say "done" without verification
